ecord on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, June to July hit 210% of normal while November to December fell to 39%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 27% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 19936 had its driest year in 1956 at 52%.</p>"}
